<!-- Relay — three-dot overflow glyph, drawn TALLER than Material's MoreVert.
     Material MoreVert (viewport 24x24) draws three r=2 dots at cy 6/12/18, so the
     drawn glyph is only 16dp tall at a 24dp icon size — visibly shorter than
     ic_search (~19.4dp) at the same size, even though the icon boxes all
     match (feedback round 7). These dots sit at cy 4.5/12/19.5 with r=2.2,
     so the glyph spans 2.3–21.7 = 19.4dp, the same drawn height as the
     search magnifier. Feedback round 8 — the call glyph is the outlier the
     other way: `ic_call_outline` fills its 19x19 viewBox edge to edge, so
     at 24dp it drew ~22dp tall; the call icon is now 22dp, drawing ~20dp
     to match. Black fill like ic_search; the Icon() call site tints it
     from the theme. -->
